===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|riden}}, from {{inh|en|ang|rīdan}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*rīdan}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*rīdaną}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*Hreydʰ-}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*h₃reyH-}}.

{{rel-top|Cognates:}}
From Proto-Germanic: {{cog|frr|ride|t=to ride}}, {{cog|stq|riede|t=to ride}}, {{cog|fy|ride|t=to ride}}, {{cog|nds|rieden|t=to ride}}, {{cog|nl|rijden|t=to ride}}, {{cog|de|reiten|t=to ride}}, {{cog|da|ride|t=to ride}}, {{cog|sv|rida|t=to ride}}.

From {{cog|ine}}: {{cog|cy|rhwyddhau|t=to hurry}}.
