|passage=Early women tobogganists '''rode''' the course in the requisite attire of their day: skirts. In spite of this hindrance, some women riders turned in very respectable performances.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To convey, as by riding; to make or do by riding.
#: {{ux|en|How many races have you '''ridden''' this year?}}
#* {{RQ:Scott Marmion|passage=The only men that safe can '''ride''' / Mine errands on the Scottish side.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive|figuratively}} To [[exploit]] or [[take advantage]] of (a situation).
