|passage=She '''rode''' him hard, and he squeezed her breasts, and she came again.}}
#* {{RQ:Noire Thug-A-Licious|page=152|passage=Isis '''rode''' my mug like she was on a ten-inch dick, and as soon as she nutted I tossed her ass off a me and flipped her on her back, then fucked the shit outta her cause it was payback time.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive|colloquial}} To [[nag]] or [[criticize]]; to [[annoy]] (someone). {{defdate|from 19th c.}}
