|passage=The nobility{{...}} could no longer endure to be '''ridden''' by bakers, coblers[sic], brewers, and the like.}}
# {{lb|en|surgery}} To overlap (each other); said of bones or fractured fragments.
# {{lb|en|radio|television|transitive}} To [[monitor]] (some component of an audiovisual signal) in order to keep it within acceptable bounds.
#: {{co|en|vocal '''riding'''}}
